  "description": "Market vibes, hot charts, and setups worth watching — give it a listen while you go on a drive or doing some chores. We hit a lot of important topics to monitor, and explain the strategy going forward",
  "body_html": "<p>We did a discussion on the overall stock market for the S&amp;P 500, which notably includes tickers like SPY, QQQ, SPX…and what the approach should be with the overall indexes. </p><p>It is important note…just because it looks “cheap” it can get ALOT “cheaper”. Dont try to catch falling knives. </p><ul><li><p># Stocks making 52 week highs: 53</p></li><li><p># Stocks making 52 week lows: 547</p></li></ul><p>We discussed that the meltup is over with. The best hope for the markets is a blow off top. That is a forecast, and a prediction. Maintain strategy. </p><p>Lastly, some stocks we reviewed:</p><ul><li><p>Silver, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SILJ&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li><li><p>Primo Brands <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$PRMB&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/look-where-others-are-not?r=4z8lgl\">Check out today’s post about Latin America, and a long term position I want to build on (click to follow)</a></p></li><li><p>Cencora <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$COR&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li><li><p>Royal Gold <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RGLD&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li><li><p>Netlflix <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NFLX&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li></ul><p>Some Viewer Requests Included:</p><ul><li><p>Palantir <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$PLTR&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li><li><p>Costco <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$COST&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li><li><p>Rocket Companies <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RKT&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li><li><p>Sarepta Therapeutics <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SRPT&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p></li></ul><p>Hope you enjoy the stream, and thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">If you enjoy StockTok’s content and find it useful, consider subscribing, and then share with someone you know!</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/market-outlook-blow-off-top-incoming?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\"></p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/market-outlook-blow-off-top-incoming?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/market-outlook-blow-off-top-incoming?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a